<FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif">
Morning everyone, figured I'd do a short AAR for Saturdays "event" in Skyshrine.<P>I had initially planned to hang out in Skyshrine and farm some gear for Kalaan, but some others expressed an interest in joining me, so we decided to take on the Courtyard and have a little fun.  Over the course of the day we had the following people show up:  Medec, Meretrixx, Doxx, Gastro, Leaff, Brinne, Erlas, and Lownar. (might have missed one, was a long day :P)<P>We had a couple problems with Suez throughout the day, but I think I was the only one who ended up dying until the near the very end when Brinne got smushed by an errant bartender.  Sorry about that Brinne.  All in all it was a pretty good time I thought, we got some drops, admittedly not as many as I was hoping for, and everyone made some exp.  Not sure how much everyone got, but it should have been a pretty decent chunk of exp.  I know I heard Gastro and Medec ding at some point during the day.  And now, for the drops:<P>Guardian Sword (Kalaan) - 9/24 +5STR, +5DEX, +3 to all saves<BR>Guardian Robe (Doxx) - AC12, +5STA, +8INT +45MANA, +8 vs Fire and Magic<BR>Guardian Girdle (Medec) - AC 12, STA+8, CHA+5, HP+1, Magic+5 <BR>Sentry Choker (Medec traded loot rights on the girdle for this) - AC 9, AGI+4, HP+5, Pois+3, Dis+3<BR>Guardian Bracer (Brinne) - AC9, DEX+3, STA+3, HP+10, MANA+10, Cold+5, Fire+5, Magic+4 <BR>Sentry Boots (Meretrixx) - AC13, AGI+3, STA+2,Cold+4<BR>Guardian Gauntlets (Brinne) - AC13, STR+3, DEX+5, AGI+2, Fire+5, Cold+5 <BR>Sapphire x 4<BR>Peridot x 3<BR>Chilling Embrace x 4<BR>Wandering Mind x 3<P>After everyone decided to call it a night from Skyshrine, I headed over to get some exp off Cyndreela at the fear gate.  I bumped heads with 3 people who said they were camping her, but they weren't anywhere to be seen when I got there.  Needless to say it was annoying, and all parties involved were partially in the wrong.  Well, shortly after they left the camp, I got hit by a lag spike and Cyndreela owned me.  /shrug  So I've currently got a corpse at the fear portal, and I'm sitting naked in Skyshrine. hehe  To make things a little more annoying, I lost my guildtag when I zoned into Skyshrine from my death.  I thought VI had fixed that damn bug.<P>Not sure when I'll be online next, but I look forward to doing some more Skyshrine farming in the near future with you all, I'd like to see Gastro get a new robe one of these days, that Crystalline Robe is just so... Blue.    <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0"><P>** Edit ** Added Boots and their stats, Gauntlets also<p>[ July 30, 2001: Message edited by: Lownar/Kalaan/Sendil ]<P>--------------------<P>Lownar Baardeth - 55th Level Gnecromancer<BR>Kalaan - 30th Level Rogue<BR>Rakasak - 19th Level Monk<BR>Bertox. Server
